{"ac":1,"ac_digest":"7cb92591d369","ac_text":"[REVIEW] The G3 self-heal demo is arc-relevant and its evidence is a valid `demo_evidence:` candidate for arc-020's G3 (self-heal) leg.","criterion_class":"unclassified","delegation_class":"REVIEWER-JUDGES","dispatch_id":"judge-t-3341-r1-cdde1a826ce4","evidence":[".context/reviews/evidence/T-3341/AC1-judge-t-3341-r1-cdde1a826ce4.md"],"evidence_sha256":{".context/reviews/evidence/T-3341/AC1-judge-t-3341-r1-cdde1a826ce4.md":"9e85d60be7b5043a360e5363ecd880014eb9a74b00e360d8cf2f7164889a2a13"},"guidance":"The mechanic is sound and arc-relevant, but the demo failed 1 of 6 runs: c1 and c2 lands=False, RESULT FAIL, exit 1, with the hub running. Make _deliver robust (readiness wait or retry on interact, and log _err). Make the Result sentence depend on ok so a failed capture does not say 'message landed'. Then show consecutive passes (for example 10/10).","id":"V-20261001-59fce523","judgement":{"contract":"judge_verdict/1","evidence":[".context/reviews/evidence/T-3341/AC1-judge-t-3341-r1-cdde1a826ce4.md"],"guidance":"The mechanic is sound and arc-relevant, but the demo failed 1 of 6 runs: c1 and c2 lands=False, RESULT FAIL, exit 1, with the hub running. Make _deliver robust (readiness wait or retry on interact, and log _err). Make the Result sentence depend on ok so a failed capture does not say 'message landed'. Then show consecutive passes (for example 10/10).","judge":"reviewer-judge-t-3341-r1-cdde1a826ce4:reviewer","judged":"T-3341#AC1","meaning":"proceed, and record the guidance against the thing judged","state":"amber","ts":"2026-10-01T14:10:01Z"},"outcome":"amber","reviewer":"reviewer-judge-t-3341-r1-cdde1a826ce4:reviewer","revision":"2a75b85f6e7c08ff62cb338a9de25baeb7b72f54","run_id":"run-t-3341-ce7b33a158","rung":"rung-1-same-vendor-independent","task":"T-3341","ts":"2026-10-01T14:10:01Z","verdict":"amber","worker":"reviewer-judge-t-3341-r1-cdde1a826ce4"}
